TEXT 0 896 Left 2 ;A1_conventional_cascode_mirror, testbench A_out
TEXT 0 936 Left 2 ;Nets are joined by their labels (same name = same net). Open in LTspice and press Run.
TEXT 0 976 Left 2 ;Output characteristic at Iin = 10 uA: plot -I(Vo) against Vo. Rout from the slope at 0.5 V (for a cleaner number use .ac on Vo).
TEXT 0 1016 Left 2 !.include ptm90.lib
TEXT 0 1056 Left 2 !.dc Vo 0 1 5m
TEXT 0 1096 Left 2 !.meas DC iout_0p5 FIND -I(Vo) AT=0.5
TEXT 0 1136 Left 2 !.meas DC gout DERIV I(Vo) AT=0.5
TEXT 0 1176 Left 2 !.meas DC rout_ohm PARAM 1/abs(gout)
